# TypeOK pairing: a write below the check records a path outside the model.
MODULE: TypeOKBypassUndeclaredPath
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a below-check write records an undeclared path
PERTURBS: Bypass

--- FIND
    /\ stored' = r /\ req' = r /\ path' = "Below" /\ origin' = "System"
--- REPLACE
    /\ stored' = r /\ req' = r /\ path' = "Unchecked" /\ origin' = "System"
--- END
